  digest=b3:73d3bf4b60a83aec9c2c00a8877250e14cbf20f4d400cf018831a46daf9b225d file=executor/tool/registry.go range=71:85 lang=go exported=false byte_range=2382:2902
  sig=func cacheKey(uri string, args map[string]interface{}) (string, bool)
  doc=cacheKey builds the canonical cache key for one (uri, args) pair. The\nargs map is JSON-encoded with sorted keys so two calls with the same\narguments in different map-iteration order produce the same key\n(determinism, i6).
